# Tell Godot to ignore this directory entirely. xr/native/ holds the
# *source* of the GDExtension(s); the runtime-loadable .so + .gdextension
# manifest live under xr/addons/<name>/. Without this file Godot would
# scan xr/native/ahb_decoder/ahb_decoder.gdextension as a *second*
# extension and try to register AhbVideoTexture twice.
